#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "`Neat` class usage {#neat-class-usage}"
msgstr "Penggunaan kelas `Neat` {#neat-class-usage}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Before submitting a resource-intensive Qiskit Runtime workload to execute on"
" hardware, you can use the Qiskit Runtime [`Neat` (Noisy Estimator Analyzer "
"Tool)](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/debug-tools-"
"neat#neat) class to verify that your Estimator workload is set up correctly,"
" is likely to return  accurate results, uses the most appropriate options "
"for the specified problem, and more.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sebelum menghantar beban kerja Qiskit Runtime yang memerlukan sumber "
"intensif untuk dilaksanakan pada perkakasan, anda boleh menggunakan kelas "
"Qiskit Runtime [`Neat` (Noisy Estimator Analyzer "
"Tool)](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/debug-tools-"
"neat#neat) untuk mengesahkan bahawa beban kerja Estimator anda disediakan "
"dengan betul, berkemungkinan mengembalikan keputusan yang tepat, menggunakan"
" pilihan yang paling sesuai untuk masalah yang ditentukan, dan banyak "
"lagi.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`Neat` Cliffordizes the input circuits for efficient simulation, while retaining its structure and depth. Clifford circuits suffer similar levels of noise and are a good proxy for studying the original circuit of interest.\n"
"First, import the relevant packages and [authenticate to the Qiskit Runtime service](/guides/cloud-setup).\n"
msgstr ""
"`Neat` melakukan proses Cliffordize ke atas Circuit input untuk simulasi yang lebih cekap, sambil mengekalkan struktur dan kedalamannya. Circuit Clifford mengalami tahap hingar yang serupa dan merupakan proksi yang baik untuk mengkaji Circuit asal yang diminati.\n"
"Mula-mula, import pakej yang berkaitan dan [sahkan diri kepada perkhidmatan Qiskit Runtime](/guides/cloud-setup).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare the environment {#prepare-the-environment}"
msgstr "Sediakan persekitaran {#prepare-the-environment}"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Initialize a target circuit {#initialize-a-target-circuit}"
msgstr "Mulakan Circuit sasaran {#initialize-a-target-circuit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Consider a six-qubit circuit that has the following properties:\n"
msgstr "Pertimbangkan Circuit enam-Qubit yang mempunyai sifat-sifat berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Alternates between random `RZ` rotations and layers of `CNOT` gates.\n"
msgstr "Berselang-seli antara putaran `RZ` rawak dan lapisan gate `CNOT`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Has a mirror structure, that is, it applies a unitary `U` followed by its "
"inverse.\n"
msgstr ""
"Mempunyai struktur cermin, iaitu, ia menggunakan unitary `U` diikuti dengan "
"inversnya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/debug-qiskit-"
"runtime-jobs/extracted-outputs/df19af55-897d-4b1f-baf8-fac2641ae87d-0.svg)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/debug-qiskit-"
"runtime-jobs/extracted-outputs/df19af55-897d-4b1f-baf8-fac2641ae87d-0.svg)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Choose single-Pauli `Z` operators as observables and use them to initialize "
"the primitive unified blocs (PUBs).\n"
msgstr ""
"Pilih operator `Z` Pauli tunggal sebagai observable dan gunakannya untuk "
"memulakan blok kesatuan primitif (PUB).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Cliffordize the circuits {#cliffordize-the-circuits}"
msgstr "Cliffordize Circuit {#cliffordize-the-circuits}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The previously defined PUB circuits are not Clifford, which makes them "
"difficult to simulate classically. However, you can use the `Neat` "
"[`to_clifford`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/debug-"
"tools-neat#to_clifford) method to map them to Clifford circuits for more "
"efficient simulation.  The "
"[`to_clifford`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/debug-"
"tools-neat#to_clifford) method is a wrapper around the "
"[`ConvertISAToClifford`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/transpiler-passes-convert-isa-to-clifford) transpiler pass, which "
"can also be used independently. In particular, it replaces non-Clifford "
"single-qubit gates in the original circuit with Clifford single-qubit gates,"
" but it does not mutate the two-qubit gates, number of qubits, or circuit "
"depth.\n"
msgstr ""
"Circuit PUB yang ditakrifkan sebelum ini bukan Clifford, yang menjadikannya "
"sukar untuk disimulasikan secara klasik. Walau bagaimanapun, anda boleh "
"menggunakan kaedah `Neat` "
"[`to_clifford`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/debug-"
"tools-neat#to_clifford) untuk memetakannya ke Circuit Clifford bagi simulasi"
" yang lebih cekap. Kaedah "
"[`to_clifford`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/debug-"
"tools-neat#to_clifford) adalah pembungkus sekitar laluan Transpiler "
"[`ConvertISAToClifford`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/transpiler-passes-convert-isa-to-clifford), yang juga boleh "
"digunakan secara bebas. Khususnya, ia menggantikan gate satu-Qubit bukan-"
"Clifford dalam Circuit asal dengan gate satu-Qubit Clifford, tetapi tidak "
"mengubah gate dua-Qubit, bilangan qubit, atau kedalaman Circuit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"See [Efficient simulation of stabilizer circuits with Qiskit Aer primitives](/guides/simulate-stabilizer-circuits) for more information about Clifford circuit simulation.\n"
"First, initialize `Neat`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Lihat [Simulasi cekap Circuit stabilizer dengan primitif Qiskit Aer](/guides/simulate-stabilizer-circuits) untuk maklumat lanjut tentang simulasi Circuit Clifford.\n"
"Mula-mula, mulakan `Neat`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Next, Cliffordize the PUBs.\n"
msgstr "Seterusnya, Cliffordize PUB.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/debug-qiskit-"
"runtime-jobs/extracted-outputs/3ad78f41-a2f8-4381-826a-ae728e081ad6-0.svg)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/debug-qiskit-"
"runtime-jobs/extracted-outputs/3ad78f41-a2f8-4381-826a-ae728e081ad6-0.svg)\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Application 1: Analyze the impact of noise on the circuit outputs "
"{#application-1-analyze-the-impact-of-noise-on-the-circuit-outputs}"
msgstr ""
"Aplikasi 1: Analisis kesan hingar ke atas output Circuit "
"{#application-1-analyze-the-impact-of-noise-on-the-circuit-outputs}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This example shows how to use `Neat` to study the impact of different noise "
"models on PUBs as a function of circuit depth by running simulations in both"
" ideal ([`ideal_sim`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/debug-tools-neat#ideal_sim)) and noisy "
"([`noisy_sim`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/debug-"
"tools-neat#noisy_sim)) conditions. This can be useful to set up expectations"
" on the quality of the experimental results before running a job on a QPU. "
"To learn more about noise models, see [Exact and noisy simulation with "
"Qiskit Aer primitives](/guides/simulate-with-qiskit-aer#exact-and-noisy-"
"simulation-with-qiskit-aer-primitives).\n"
msgstr ""
"Contoh ini menunjukkan cara menggunakan `Neat` untuk mengkaji kesan model "
"hingar yang berbeza ke atas PUB sebagai fungsi kedalaman Circuit dengan "
"menjalankan simulasi dalam keadaan ideal "
"([`ideal_sim`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/debug-"
"tools-neat#ideal_sim)) dan berhingar "
"([`noisy_sim`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/debug-"
"tools-neat#noisy_sim)). Ini boleh berguna untuk menetapkan jangkaan terhadap"
" kualiti keputusan eksperimen sebelum menjalankan kerja pada QPU. Untuk "
"mengetahui lebih lanjut tentang model hingar, lihat [Simulasi tepat dan "
"berhingar dengan primitif Qiskit Aer](/guides/simulate-with-qiskit-"
"aer#exact-and-noisy-simulation-with-qiskit-aer-primitives).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The simulated results support mathematical operations, and can therefore be "
"compared with each other (or with experimental results) to calculate figures"
" of merit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Keputusan yang disimulasikan menyokong operasi matematik, dan oleh itu boleh"
" dibandingkan antara satu sama lain (atau dengan keputusan eksperimen) untuk"
" mengira angka merit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\">\n"
"A QPU can be affected by different kinds of noise. The Qiskit Aer noise model used here only simulates some of them and therefore is likely to be less severe than the noise on a real QPU.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\">\n"
"QPU boleh dipengaruhi oleh pelbagai jenis hingar. Model hingar Qiskit Aer yang digunakan di sini hanya mensimulasikan sebahagian daripadanya dan oleh itu berkemungkinan kurang teruk berbanding hingar pada QPU sebenar.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For details on what errors are included when initializing a noise model from a QPU, see the Aer [`NoiseModel`](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-aer/stubs/qiskit_aer.noise.NoiseModel.html#qiskit_aer.noise.NoiseModel.from_backend) API reference.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk butiran tentang ralat yang disertakan apabila memulakan model hingar dari QPU, lihat rujukan API Aer [`NoiseModel`](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-aer/stubs/qiskit_aer.noise.NoiseModel.html#qiskit_aer.noise.NoiseModel.from_backend).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Begin by performing ideal and noisy classical simulations.\n"
msgstr "Mulakan dengan menjalankan simulasi klasik yang ideal dan berhingar.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Next, apply mathematical operations to compute the absolute difference. The "
"remainder of the guide uses the absolute difference as a figure of merit to "
"compare ideal results with noisy or experimental results, but similar "
"figures of merit can be set up.\n"
msgstr ""
"Seterusnya, gunakan operasi matematik untuk mengira perbezaan mutlak. "
"Selebihnya panduan ini menggunakan perbezaan mutlak sebagai angka merit "
"untuk membandingkan keputusan ideal dengan keputusan berhingar atau "
"eksperimen, tetapi angka merit yang serupa boleh disediakan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The absolute difference shows that the impact of noise grows with the "
"circuits' sizes.\n"
msgstr ""
"Perbezaan mutlak menunjukkan bahawa kesan hingar meningkat seiring dengan "
"saiz Circuit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can follow these rough and simplified guidelines to improve circuits of "
"this type:\n"
msgstr ""
"Anda boleh mengikuti garis panduan kasar dan ringkas ini untuk menambah baik"
" Circuit jenis ini:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If the mean absolute difference is greater than 90%, mitigation will likely "
"not help.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika perbezaan mutlak min melebihi 90%, mitigasi berkemungkinan tidak akan "
"membantu.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If the mean absolute difference is less than 90%, [Probabilistic Error "
"Amplification (PEA)](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-"
"techniques#probabilistic-error-amplification-pea) will likely be able to "
"improve the results.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika perbezaan mutlak min kurang daripada 90%, [Probabilistic Error "
"Amplification (PEA)](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-"
"techniques#probabilistic-error-amplification-pea) berkemungkinan dapat "
"meningkatkan keputusan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If the mean absolute difference is less than 80%, [ZNE with gate "
"folding](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#zero-noise-"
"extrapolation-zne) will also likely be able to improve the results.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika perbezaan mutlak min kurang daripada 80%, [ZNE dengan pelipatan "
"gate](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#zero-noise-"
"extrapolation-zne) juga berkemungkinan dapat meningkatkan keputusan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Because all of the absolute differences above are less than 90%, applying PEA to the original circuit will hopefully improve the quality of its results.\n"
"You can specify different noise models in the analyzer. The following example performs the same test but adds a custom noise model.\n"
msgstr ""
"Oleh kerana semua perbezaan mutlak di atas kurang daripada 90%, menggunakan PEA pada Circuit asal diharapkan dapat meningkatkan kualiti keputusannya.\n"
"Anda boleh menentukan model hingar yang berbeza dalam analyzer. Contoh berikut menjalankan ujian yang sama tetapi menambah model hingar tersuai.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"As shown, given a noise model, you can try to quantify the impact of noise "
"on the (Cliffordized version of the) PUBs of interest before running them on"
" a QPU.\n"
msgstr ""
"Seperti yang ditunjukkan, dengan model hingar yang diberikan, anda boleh "
"cuba mengukur kesan hingar ke atas PUB (versi yang telah di-Cliffordize) "
"yang diminati sebelum menjalankannya pada QPU.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Application 2: Benchmark different strategies {#application-2-benchmark-"
"different-strategies}"
msgstr ""
"Aplikasi 2: Bandingkan strategi yang berbeza {#application-2-benchmark-"
"different-strategies}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This example uses `Neat` to help identify the best options for your PUBs. To"
" do so, consider running an estimation problem with PEA, which cannot be "
"simulated with `qiskit_aer`. You can use `Neat` to help determine which "
"noise amplification factors will work best, then use those factors when "
"running the original experiment on a QPU.\n"
msgstr ""
"Contoh ini menggunakan `Neat` untuk membantu mengenal pasti pilihan terbaik "
"untuk PUB anda. Untuk berbuat demikian, pertimbangkan untuk menjalankan "
"masalah anggaran dengan PEA, yang tidak boleh disimulasikan dengan "
"`qiskit_aer`. Anda boleh menggunakan `Neat` untuk membantu menentukan faktor"
" amplifikasi hingar yang paling sesuai, kemudian gunakan faktor tersebut "
"apabila menjalankan eksperimen asal pada QPU.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The result with the smallest difference suggests which options to choose.\n"
msgstr ""
"Keputusan dengan perbezaan terkecil mencadangkan pilihan mana yang perlu "
"dipilih.\n"

